{
  "title": { "zh": "找近邻", "en": "Nearest neighbour" },
  "after": {
    "zh": "编码器把同一张图的各种变形放到特征空间里相近的地方，再按余弦相似度找最近的一个：这就是以图搜图。对比学习练出来的编码器，正好适合这件事。",
    "en": "The encoder puts the different versions of one picture close together in feature space; then the nearest one by cosine similarity is found. This is image search, and an encoder trained by contrastive learning is just right for it."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "托盘里的<part-ref to=\"embed\"></part-ref>把一张图变成一组特征，同一张图的各种变形得到的特征很接近。",
        "en": "The <part-ref to=\"embed\"></part-ref> in the tray turns a picture into a set of features, and different versions of the same picture get features close to each other."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两组特征有多像，可以用余弦相似度来量：长度为 1 的两组特征，对应相乘再加起来。",
        "en": "How alike two sets of features are can be measured by cosine similarity: for two sets of features of length 1, multiply them pair by pair and add up."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：三张候选里找出和要找的照片是同一张的那一张。",
        "en": "Your task in this level: among three candidates, find the one that is the same photo as the one you are looking for."
      },
      "fig": { "test": 0, "caption": { "zh": "第一组：T 找 T", "en": "Set 1: T finds T" } }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "5-8",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "三张候选里有一张和要找的是同一张照片，只是挪了一点、调了颜色或加了噪声。是它的那一路输出 1，其余输出 0。",
        "en": "One of the three candidates is the same photo as the one to find, only shifted a little, recoloured or noisy. Output 1 on its line and 0 on the others."
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "逐像素比，亮的陌生人反而显得近。先把每张照片换成编码器的特征再比。",
        "en": "Compared pixel by pixel, a bright stranger looks closer. Turn every photo into the encoder's features before comparing."
      },
      "inputs": ["q", "a", "b", "c"],
      "inputLabels": {
        "q": { "zh": "要找的照片", "en": "Photo to find" },
        "a": { "zh": "候选 a", "en": "Candidate a" },
        "b": { "zh": "候选 b", "en": "Candidate b" },
        "c": { "zh": "候选 c", "en": "Candidate c" }
      },
      "outputs": ["pa", "pb", "pc"],
      "outputLabels": { "pa": { "zh": "是 a", "en": "Is a" }, "pb": { "zh": "是 b", "en": "Is b" }, "pc": { "zh": "是 c", "en": "Is c" } },
      "scene": "nearest",
      "tests": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "T 找 T", "en": "T finds T" },
          "q": { "glyph": { "letter": "T" } },
          "candidates": [
            { "glyph": { "letter": "L", "lo": 0.3, "hi": 1 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "T", "lo": 0.2, "hi": 0.7, "ox": 4 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "F" } }
          ],
          "which": 1
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "X 找 X", "en": "X finds X" },
          "q": { "noisy": { "of": { "glyph": { "letter": "X" } }, "seed": 3, "amp": 0.1 } },
          "candidates": [
            { "glyph": { "letter": "X", "hi": 0.6, "oy": 4 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "O", "lo": 0.2, "hi": 1 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "T" } }
          ],
          "which": 0
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "O 找 O", "en": "O finds O" },
          "q": { "glyph": { "letter": "O", "ox": 2 } },
          "candidates": [
            { "glyph": { "letter": "F", "lo": 0.3, "hi": 1 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "L" } },
            { "noisy": { "of": { "glyph": { "letter": "O", "lo": 0.3, "hi": 0.6 } }, "seed": 5, "amp": 0.08 } }
          ],
          "which": 2
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "F 找 F", "en": "F finds F" },
          "q": { "glyph": { "letter": "F", "lo": 0.2 } },
          "candidates": [
            { "glyph": { "letter": "T", "lo": 0.3, "hi": 1 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "F", "hi": 0.7, "ox": 4, "oy": 4 } },
            { "glyph": { "letter": "X" } }
          ],
          "which": 1
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "eq = embed(q)",
        "ea = embed(a)",
        "eb = embed(b)",
        "ec = embed(c)",
        "ma = arith[op=mul](eq, ea)",
        "mb = arith[op=mul](eq, eb)",
        "mc = arith[op=mul](eq, ec)",
        "sa = fqMean(ma)",
        "sb = fqMean(mb)",
        "sc = fqMean(mc)",
        "xa = max(sb, sc)",
        "xb = max(sa, sc)",
        "xc = max(sa, sb)",
        "da = arith[op=sub](sa, xa)",
        "db = arith[op=sub](sb, xb)",
        "dc = arith[op=sub](sc, xc)",
        "ta = threshold[t=0](da)",
        "tb = threshold[t=0](db)",
        "tc = threshold[t=0](dc)",
        "pa <- ta",
        "pb <- tb",
        "pc <- tc"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "ma = arith[op=mul](q, a)",
        "mb = arith[op=mul](q, b)",
        "mc = arith[op=mul](q, c)",
        "sa = fqMean(ma)",
        "sb = fqMean(mb)",
        "sc = fqMean(mc)",
        "xa = max(sb, sc)",
        "xb = max(sa, sc)",
        "xc = max(sa, sb)",
        "da = arith[op=sub](sa, xa)",
        "db = arith[op=sub](sb, xb)",
        "dc = arith[op=sub](sc, xc)",
        "ta = threshold[t=0](da)",
        "tb = threshold[t=0](db)",
        "tc = threshold[t=0](dc)",
        "pa <- ta",
        "pb <- tb",
        "pc <- tc"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
